Fork-only testcase on branch pr124666-fix, never submitted to upstream
or uploaded to Bugzilla.  Retrospective attribution header added as
part of a manual Bugzilla-provenance audit on 2026-04-22 (meta-repo
tracking commit 40f0a94; GitHub issues on krystophny/gcc-dev).  The
reducer originated from the Fujitsu Compiler Test Suite (Apache-2.0
WITH LLVM-exception, GPLv3-compatible).  Adding the provenance header
now so the chain of custody is in place before any future upstream
submission.  No behavioural change.

